SUMMARY:Holiday Market ft. Chalwa
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this year’s Holiday Market with over 20 local artists and vendors.  Relax and shop while the classic vibes of Chalwa’s Original Mountain Reggae music floats through the Autumn air! \n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom with live music several days a week\, plus our outdoor music venue in the summer and fall months with live music frequently on WNC’s premier outdoor music venue\, the Pisgah Brewing Outdoor Stage. Be sure to come thirsty and ready rock! Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/holiday-market-ft-chalwa/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/holiday-market-with-chalwa-e1793565986707.jpeg
GEO:35.6068069;-82.3568213
