SUMMARY:474 Gallery Studio Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:We’re throwing a community fundraiser for 474 Gallery Studio on Saturday\, November 21\, from noon to 6 PM at New Belgium Brewing! After being displaced by the I-240 highway expansion\, we’re working hard to finish building our new home in West Asheville\, and we could use your support getting there. \nWe’ll have live music\, a silent auction featuring local artists and businesses\, live painting by local artists\, plus live screen printing by Jerry Cahill. Come hang out\, enjoy the afternoon\, support local art\, and help us get the new studio across the finish line!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/474-gallery-studio-fundraiser/
LOCATION:New Belgium Brewing
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
