SUMMARY:Womansong of Asheville: We Are Multitudes Choral Music Concert
DESCRIPTION:Womansong is back again with a beautiful concert highlighting the words of Walt Whitman\, “We Are Multitudes!” \n\n\n\n\nJoin Womansong for our fall concert series\, “We Are Multitudes!” Inspired by the Walt Whitman quote\, “I contain multitudes\,” our music celebrates the varied and multifaceted nature of women. Songs range from feminist banners like Helen Reddy’s “I Am Woman” and Aretha Franklin’s “Respect” to a few new tunes we picked up at the Sister Singers Festival in Chicago this past summer. Mark your calendars and join us for an show with live singing\, full band and positive community! \n\nDoors open 30 min before performance\nFree for children under 12 years old\nLimited parking – carpooling recommended\nTickets $25 at the door if available Event Details and Tickets
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/womansong-of-asheville-we-are-multitudes-choral-music-concert/2026-11-21/
LOCATION:Unitarian Universalist Congregation of Asheville
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
END:VEVENT
